# Optional commit-specific live verify markers (NestPOS).
#
# Used by scripts/ci-live-verify.sh AFTER deploy on GitHub Actions.
# Format (one per line):
#   /pos/path|Human feature name|regex
#
# Rules:
#   - Non-secret markers only (no credentials)
#   - Prefer language-independent DOM ids / data-* attributes
#   - Do not add customer-specific assertions
#   - Leave empty / omit file when the default NestPOS profile is enough
#
# Example (commented):
# /pos/dashboard|Aaj ka Khaata|id="today-khata"
# /pos/invoice/create|sale root|data-tn-sale-root
